  "title": "Dairy-Free Chocolate Pudding",
  "description": "This dairy-free chocolate pudding is simple to make with soy milk and simple pantry ingredients. It's a great vegan dessert option for two!",
  "authors": [
    "Kathleen Amos-Robel"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-05-30T02:24:45-04:00",
